WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:17.760
Loro followed Zella and Raff as they moved away from the cave.

2
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.661
He didn't know the other two kids very well yet.

3
00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:26.262
He wasn't sure whether they would give up on exploring the cave or try again after the mayor

4
00:00:26.302 --> 00:00:26.823
was gone.

5
00:00:26.843 --> 00:00:31.764
"Yikes! I can't believe the mayor was so angry at us," Zella said.

6
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.062
"I've never seen her yell at anyone like that."

7
00:00:35.082 --> 00:00:38.264
"Yeah." Raff sounded upset.

8
00:00:38.284 --> 00:00:41.026
"Usually she's so calm and friendly."

9
00:00:41.046 --> 00:00:46.690
"She must be really worried about the Sovereign's Staff's disappearance," Zella said.

10
00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.212
"Plus, this cave is so close to Stone Wall.

11
00:00:50.993 --> 00:00:55.496
If King Zanta left a lot of old relics lying around inside, it could be dangerous here.

12
00:00:56.176 --> 00:00:57.958
And it's her job to protect everyone."

13
00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:01.040
"I still don't get it," Raff said.

14
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:03.598
"How did she know we were in the cave?"

15
00:01:04.518 --> 00:01:05.439
He looked at Loro.

16
00:01:05.459 --> 00:01:08.522
"Are you sure she didn't see you?"

17
00:01:08.542 --> 00:01:10.684
"I'm pretty sure."

18
00:01:11.064 --> 00:01:11.885
Loro shrugged.

19
00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:15.668
"She just stomped right over to the cave and went inside."

20
00:01:15.688 --> 00:01:20.772
"Well, I don't know how she found us, and I don't care," Zella said.

21
00:01:20.792 --> 00:01:23.815
"Let's hide in the bushes until she comes out.

22
00:01:24.896 --> 00:01:26.897
After she leaves, we can sneak back in.

23
00:01:27.898 --> 00:01:29.800
She probably won't expect us to do that."

24
00:01:30.648 --> 00:01:32.109
"Are you serious, Zella?"

25
00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:34.531
Raff looked dismayed.

26
00:01:34.551 --> 00:01:37.293
"We could get in serious trouble!

27
00:01:38.053 --> 00:01:41.396
If Mom and Dad find out Loro cleared his throat.

28
00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:44.338
"He's right, Zella.

29
00:01:45.098 --> 00:01:47.120
It's too risky to go back in right now.

30
00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:51.163
Besides, don't you want to wait for a reply from Zann?

31
00:01:51.683 --> 00:01:54.765
Maybe he has some good ideas about how to find the staff."

32
00:01:55.626 --> 00:01:56.927
Zella brightened slightly.

33
00:01:56.947 --> 00:01:58.468
"That's true."

34
00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:00.373
Then she frowned.

35
00:02:00.393 --> 00:02:02.815
"But I still don't want to wait.

36
00:02:03.816 --> 00:02:06.698
If someone stole that staff, we need to know right away!

37
00:02:07.419 --> 00:02:09.420
Especially if it's a dangerous relic!"

38
00:02:10.221 --> 00:02:11.362
Loro felt worried.

39
00:02:12.163 --> 00:02:15.245
Zella seemed determined to go back into the cave right away.

40
00:02:15.265 --> 00:02:19.529
"It's too dangerous for them to wander around in there," he thought.

41
00:02:20.289 --> 00:02:22.711
Meanwhile Raff was looking around the clearing.

42
00:02:22.732 --> 00:02:25.514
"Hey, where's Muncher?

43
00:02:26.154 --> 00:02:27.756
I thought he'd be out here eating weeds."

44
00:02:28.864 --> 00:02:31.105
"He was here when I came out," Loro said.

45
00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:33.305
"I might have startled him.

46
00:02:34.145 --> 00:02:37.366
As soon as he saw me, he made a noise and ran into the woods."

47
00:02:38.227 --> 00:02:40.887
"That's weird," Raff said.

48
00:02:40.907 --> 00:02:43.168
"He isn't usually skittish."

49
00:02:43.188 --> 00:02:45.749
"He probably went home."

50
00:02:46.269 --> 00:02:47.689
Zella sounded distracted.

51
00:02:48.469 --> 00:02:50.590
Loro glanced toward the cave entrance.

52
00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:54.571
"We shouldn't be talking here where the mayor might hear us.

53
00:02:55.491 --> 00:02:58.172
Let's go hide in the woods behind the wormhole."

54
00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.801
"Sounds good to me," Zella said.

55
00:03:00.821 --> 00:03:03.904
"I want to take another look at that wormhole anyway."

56
00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.385
She hurried across the clearing.

57
00:03:06.645 --> 00:03:07.886
Loro and Raff followed her.

58
00:03:07.906 --> 00:03:10.848
"Is your sister always like this?"

59
00:03:11.389 --> 00:03:12.910
Loro asked in a low voice.

60
00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:16.352
"She's, um, pretty adventurous."

61
00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:17.833
Raff sighed.

62
00:03:17.853 --> 00:03:23.617
"Yes. Except there usually aren't many adventures in Stone Wall."

63
00:03:24.718 --> 00:03:27.300
Up ahead, Zella stepped closer to the wormhole.

64
00:03:28.372 --> 00:03:29.572
It swirled open.

65
00:03:29.592 --> 00:03:31.973
"Be careful, Zella," Raff called.

66
00:03:31.993 --> 00:03:36.554
"I'm fine," she said, staring into the spinning depths.

67
00:03:36.574 --> 00:03:40.215
"It's so strange how this wormhole just appeared here."

68
00:03:40.235 --> 00:03:44.156
"Wormholes can pop up anywhere," Raff said.

69
00:03:44.176 --> 00:03:48.578
"At least that's what our teacher told us when we studied them in school."

70
00:03:48.598 --> 00:03:51.078
"I know," Zella said.

71
00:03:51.098 --> 00:03:56.020
"I just think it's an odd coincidence that this one appeared right by a hidden cave that had

72
00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.440
a powerful relic inside.

73
00:03:58.284 --> 00:04:00.746
Maybe the two things are connected somehow."

74
00:04:00.766 --> 00:04:04.408
"Maybe there is a connection," Loro said.

75
00:04:04.428 --> 00:04:08.250
"But don't forget—we're not sure that thing is a relic.

76
00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:12.992
It could be just an ordinary old staff that someone left there."

77
00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:16.354
Zella was still staring into the wormhole.

78
00:04:16.374 --> 00:04:19.336
"I wonder what it would be like to jump in there.

79
00:04:20.416 --> 00:04:23.858
Zann and his friends used the vortex to visit all kinds of other worlds."

80
00:04:24.759 --> 00:04:27.876
"Right, like Fardark."

81
00:04:27.896 --> 00:04:28.757
Raff shook his head.

82
00:04:28.777 --> 00:04:32.500
"No thanks, I definitely don't want to go there."

83
00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:35.763
"Not just Fardark," Zella said.

84
00:04:35.783 --> 00:04:38.165
"They visited nice worlds too.

85
00:04:38.965 --> 00:04:41.508
There was Mistafar, where their friend Ello lives.

86
00:04:42.488 --> 00:04:45.271
And Niffia, where the people are intelligent and friendly."

87
00:04:45.291 --> 00:04:49.334
"And where the people have no noses," Raff said.

88
00:04:49.354 --> 00:04:53.678
"You told me that Niffia stinks worse than Muncher when he passes gas!"

89
00:04:54.619 --> 00:04:55.219
Zella laughed.

90
00:04:57.348 --> 00:05:01.210
"Okay, but I'd still like to visit, at least for a short time.

91
00:05:02.091 --> 00:05:03.952
I'd also love to see Pax and Zon.

92
00:05:04.292 --> 00:05:05.533
Oh! And also Rood.

93
00:05:06.173 --> 00:05:08.734
You can visit every wormhole in the vortex from there!"

94
00:05:09.935 --> 00:05:14.558
She went on to describe several other interesting worlds she'd heard about from the kid heroes.

95
00:05:15.558 --> 00:05:17.659
Loro was surprised by some of her stories.

96
00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:21.361
He'd known that Zann and the others had traveled a lot.

97
00:05:22.562 --> 00:05:25.884
But it sounded as if they'd visited even more worlds than he'd realized.

98
00:05:26.892 --> 00:05:28.713
He would have to tell his parents when he saw them.

99
00:05:28.733 --> 00:05:33.475
"I wish I could visit Gabble," Zella went on wistfully.

100
00:05:33.495 --> 00:05:36.016
"Everything there has a voice.

101
00:05:37.036 --> 00:05:40.298
You can say hello to a rock and have a conversation with a tree!"

102
00:05:41.558 --> 00:05:42.779
Raff rolled his eyes.

103
00:05:43.799 --> 00:05:49.782
"You should probably visit First City before you go twirling off through the vortex like some country bumpkin."

104
00:05:49.802 --> 00:05:51.642
"Very funny."

105
00:05:52.523 --> 00:05:55.424
Zella turned away from the wormhole to scowl at her brother.

106
00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:59.963
"For now, I'm stuck living in Stone Wall—with you!

107
00:06:01.284 --> 00:06:05.947
But someday I'll visit interesting places and have exciting adventures, just like Zann."

108
00:06:07.428 --> 00:06:09.869
"Let's go back to the village," Loro said.

109
00:06:09.889 --> 00:06:13.132
"We can have a snack and talk about what to do next."

110
00:06:13.892 --> 00:06:17.435
Before the others could respond, a spy fly buzzed into view.

111
00:06:18.555 --> 00:06:21.537
It circled the three kids, and then zipped toward Zella.

112
00:06:22.158 --> 00:06:25.080
She let out a cry of surprise as it burrowed into her ear.

113
00:06:26.237 --> 00:06:26.898
"Oh wow!"

114
00:06:27.259 --> 00:06:27.640
she said.

115
00:06:28.282 --> 00:06:30.789
Loro saw her face light up with excitement.

116
00:06:30.809 --> 00:06:34.238
"It's a video message from Zann and Perda!"
